<p> Oper revs	 4,421,107		3,743,867</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 oper shr figures exclude a $93 million, or $0.66 a share, after-tax, non-recurring non-cash gain on an exchange of broadcast stations in December 1996.</p>
